sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant FE as frontend 5173
  participant API as Express /api/auth
  participant OTP as otpService + Twilio Verify
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant DA as dashboard 5174

  Note over User,DA: Signup path SignUp.jsx
  User->>FE: 10-digit mobile
  FE->>API: POST /otp/send purpose=signup
  API->>DB: rate limit 3 challenges / 5 min
  API->>OTP: createChallenge sendSmsOtp
  OTP-->>User: SMS OTP Twilio Verify
  User->>FE: OTP
  FE->>API: POST /register/verify-mobile
  API->>OTP: verifyChallenge
  API-->>FE: verificationToken JWT 15m
  User->>FE: name email password
  FE->>API: POST /register Joi + verificationToken
  API->>DB: bcrypt password generateClientId Fund 0
  API-->>FE: Set-Cookie token httpOnly 1d
  FE->>DA: redirect localhost:5174/dashboard

  Note over User,DA: OTP login Login.jsx
  User->>FE: mobile
  FE->>API: POST /otp/send purpose=login
  API->>DB: user must exist generic error if not
  FE->>API: POST /login/otp
  API-->>FE: cookie sameSite lax
  FE->>DA: redirect dashboard

  Note over DA,API: Session restore
  DA->>API: GET /me cookie
  API->>API: isLoggedIn jwt.verify + tokenVersion
  alt valid
    API-->>DA: user name email mobile clientId status role
  else missing/invalid/stale version
    DA->>FE: window.location 5173/login
  end
